<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	  19.25   2.39</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld	12.96   5.40</p>
<p> 3   Pac Mutal Aust	  12.45   2.41</p>
<p> 4   Multistack		10.34   0.29</p>
<p> 5   Kurts (P) Prop	  10.34   1.45</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr	 10.32   0.95</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	   10.11   0.90</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv	 10.01   1.02</p>
<p> 9   BT Prop Trust	    9.89   1.65</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	  9.80   1.08</p>
<p>11   Villa World		9.62   1.04</p>
<p>12   Central Equity	   9.47   0.95</p>
<p>13   Gandel Retail Tr	 9.18   0.85</p>
<p>14   Centro Prop		8.86   2.20</p>
